{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"712fded6-140a-4544-9289-a2539e5be1e5","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have repaired the RBAC Policy Engine \u0026 Audit Trail across all four modules:\n\n- **[models.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-012_26848_1795229381846_baseline/models.py)**: Ensured `Role.parents` is converted and deep-copied into an independent tuple, validated `Rule.effect` (`\"allow\"` / `\"deny\"`), and normalized `Decision` fields (`bool` and `str`).\n- **[matcher.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-012_26848_1795229381846_baseline/matcher.py)**: Implemented `valid_resource` to strictly validate relative slash-separated segments containing only `[A-Za-z0-9_.-]` while rejecting standalone `\".\"`/`\"..\"`, empty segments, leading/trailing slashes, backslashes, wildcards, and encodings without normalizing paths. Updated `matches` to fail closed on invalid resources or malformed patterns, supporting `*`, exact literal paths, and `/*` prefix descendant matching at slash boundaries.\n- **[audit.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-012_26848_1795229381846_baseline/audit.py)**: Removed the early return on denied decisions in `AuditLog.record` so all decisions (allows, explicit/implicit denies, and invalid resources) are recorded as deep-copied dicts with `roles` as a list and expanded `allowed`/`reason` fields.\n- **[policy_engine.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-012_26848_1795229381846_baseline/policy_engine.py)**: Made `resolve_roles` cycle-safe by skipping already-visited roles, and updated `decide` to evaluate all reachable rules with explicit deny precedence (`\"explicit_deny\"`, `\"allow\"`, `\"no_matching_allow\"`, `\"invalid_resource\"`).\n","duration_seconds":114.852463,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":44486,"output_tokens":6189,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_to